@startuml 工作流状态机时序图（简化版）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 40
skinparam ParticipantPadding 5

' 大幅减少参与者数量
participant "CommandEngine" as Engine
participant "EventBus" as EventBus
participant "FireWorker" as Worker
participant "Handler\n+ StateAction" as Handler
participant "Graph" as Graph
participant "DispatchQueue" as Queue
participant "TaskClient" as Client
participant "Worker" as WorkerNode
participant "DB" as DB

== 1. 工作流启动 ==

Engine -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 入队
Engine --> Engine: 返回

== 2. 事件处理 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll() (每100ms)
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> Handler: 选择 WorkflowRunningStateAction
Handler -> Graph: getStartNodes()
Graph --> Handler: 起始任务
Handler -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)

== 3. 任务启动 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: TaskStartLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> DB: insert(taskInstance)
Handler -> Handler: 选择 TaskSubmittedStateAction
Handler -> EventBus: publish(TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent)

== 4. 任务分发 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> DB: updateById(状态: SUBMITTED_SUCCESS)
Handler -> Queue: dispatchTaskExecuteRunnableWithDelay()

== 5. Worker执行 ==

Queue -> Client: dispatch()
Client -> DB: updateById(状态: DISPATCH)
Client -> WorkerNode: RPC调用 dispatchTask()
WorkerNode -> WorkerNode: 执行任务
WorkerNode --> Client: 执行完成

== 6. 任务完成 ==

WorkerNode -> EventBus: RPC回调\npublish(TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent)

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> DB: updateById(状态: SUCCESS)
Handler -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent)

== 7. 触发后续任务 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> Graph: getSuccessors()
Graph --> Handler: 后续任务列表
Handler -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)

note right of Handler: 回到阶段3，循环执行\n直到所有任务完成

== 8. 工作流完成 ==

Handler -> Graph: isAllTaskFinish()?
Graph --> Handler: true
Handler -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent)

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle()
Handler -> DB: updateById(状态: SUCCESS)
Handler -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowFinalizeLifecycleEvent)

@enduml
